{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Blossom's Grove</strong>, a charming farming adventure where you cultivate vibrant flowers, juicy fruits, and fresh vegetables in a cozy countryside village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled between rolling hills and lush forests, your farm awaits\u2014ready for you to plant, grow, and harvest nature\u2019s bounty. But <strong>Blossom's Grove</strong> is more than just farming! Befriend a delightful cast of villagers, each with their own unique stories, quirks, and heartwarming quests. From the cheerful baker who loves sunflowers to the shy forager hiding secrets in the woods, every character adds life to your rural paradise.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673180?t=1747649987","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673180/6f4e1971b25b9c22a2d879f978415be0be1df8cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747649987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673180/d8bad3a701d01b297bba08d05eb271b9551a9286/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747649987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673180/d8bad3a701d01b297bba08d05eb271b9551a9286/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747649987","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Blossom's Grove</strong>, a charming farming adventure where you cultivate vibrant flowers, juicy fruits, and fresh vegetables in a cozy countryside village!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nestled between rolling hills and lush forests, your farm awaits\u2014ready for you to plant, grow, and harvest nature\u2019s bounty. But <str